# Line endings are load-bearing for the launchers.
#
# A .command file checked out with CRLF fails on macOS with
# "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M" — the carriage return becomes part of
# the interpreter path. cmd.exe is the mirror case and wants CRLF. Neither can
# be left to the client's autocrlf setting, because the ZIP that users download
# is built from whatever is in the repo.
*.command text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.bat     text eol=crlf

# Generated binaries in a run directory, if one is ever committed by accident.
*.png  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
